{"at": "2026-11-23T22:26:09.049494+00:00", "event_id": "01M8588G0SJV9B3GSQ51XCWMS3", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M84X1S1BM3T10WV4D4PEM8VH", "final_answer": "A: the Incident and breach response and Business continuity templates use kind How-To and are placed under operations/runbooks/, so type Runbook is derived. Role is the only vocabulary change. Decider: operator (verbatim \"as recommended\", dispatcher session, ledger R81, to the dispatcher prompt \"#402: Q2 and Q3. I recommend A for both\"; relayed by the dispatcher; checked against the dispatcher transcript).", "mission_id": "01M84X0RH8AJE7NXQK093SGRF0", "mission_slug": "operating-model-templates-01M84X0R", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-23T22:26:09.049494Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M84X1S1BM3T10WV4D4PEM8VH", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-23T22:26:09.048399Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-23T22:26:10.857044+00:00", "event_id": "01M8588HS9YVZXTJ2VTFGBN5QS", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M84X1TXTTJM09B0G0YN2G9BM", "final_answer": "A: a kind Role page requires role (a non-empty string) and responsibilities (a non-empty list of non-empty strings); goals stays optional. Decider: operator (verbatim \"as recommended\", dispatcher session, ledger R81, to the dispatcher prompt \"#402: Q2 and Q3. I recommend A for both\"; relayed by the dispatcher; checked against the dispatcher transcript).", "mission_id": "01M84X0RH8AJE7NXQK093SGRF0", "mission_slug": "operating-model-templates-01M84X0R", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-23T22:26:10.857044Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M84X1TXTTJM09B0G0YN2G9BM", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-23T22:26:10.856100Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
